# The game: its maps, and which of them is the hub the others are driven to from
# (apps/viewer/src/shell.rs). A map whose scene has not been baked is on the signs, and
# cannot be driven yet.
hub crossroads

map crossroads assets/hub.solstice The Crossroads
about crossroads A dirt main road through the high country, with a trailhead for every track.
kind crossroads Main road
length crossroads 3.0 km

map town assets/town.solstice Ironbark Flat
about town What is left of a gold town, down the main road: a hotel, a store, a hall, and a man who buys gold by weight. Park in his yard with the tray full.
kind town Township

map wombat assets/outback.solstice Wombat Creek Track
about wombat A washed-out fire trail through stringybark and manna gum: two creek fords, bog holes, rock steps and ruts cut by a wet winter.
kind wombat Fire trail
length wombat 3.5 km

map granite assets/granite.solstice Granite Ridge
about granite High, steep, stony country. A track of slabs and ledges up and over the ridge, dry underfoot: low range, lockers in, and pick your line.
kind granite Rock crawl
length granite 5.0 km

map blackwood assets/blackwood.solstice Blackwood Gully
about blackwood Low, wet forest along a creek. Sixteen bog holes, deep ruts and washouts between them: keep your momentum and air the tyres down.
kind blackwood Mud run
length blackwood 4.5 km
